@startuml
title Role Match And Roadmap
actor Client
participant "Express API" as API
participant "authMiddleware" as Auth
participant "analysis.service" as Analysis
participant "roadmap.service" as Roadmap
database "MongoDB" as DB
participant "Dev2Vec Python" as D2V
participant "Gemini LLM" as LLM

Client -> API: POST /api/analysis/role-matches
API -> Auth: verify JWT
API -> Analysis: generateRoleMatches(user, body)
Analysis -> DB: resolve latest analysis/repository source
Analysis -> D2V: optional inference for selected source
D2V --> Analysis: role matches / gaps
Analysis --> Client: role match response

Client -> API: POST /api/roadmaps/generate
API -> Auth: verify JWT
API -> Roadmap: generateRoadmap(user, body)
Roadmap -> DB: load profile + analysis/gap context
Roadmap -> LLM: generate roadmap JSON
LLM --> Roadmap: roadmap text/JSON
Roadmap -> DB: create Roadmap
Roadmap -> DB: create RoadmapProgress
Roadmap --> Client: roadmap response

alt LLM parse/provider failure
  Roadmap -> Roadmap: fallback/default parsing behavior
  Roadmap --> Client: generated or error response
end
@enduml
